<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="Untitled world"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="ReoNa"/><amll:meta key="album" value="Untitled world"/><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="1455699833"/><amll:meta key="qqMusicId" value="268882784"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="120582291"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="atemukesu"/></metadata></head><body dur="3:55.248"><div begin="15.843" end="3:55.248"><p begin="15.843" end="17.706" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="15.843" end="16.146">What</span> <span begin="16.146" end="16.459">do</span> <span begin="16.459" end="16.885">I</span> <span begin="16.885" end="17.378">believe</span> <span begin="17.378" end="17.706">in？</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我在相信什么？</span></p><p begin="18.042" end="20.936" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="18.042" end="18.349">破</span><span begin="18.349" end="18.830">裂</span><span begin="18.830" end="18.968">し</span><span begin="18.968" end="19.118">そ</span><span begin="19.118" end="19.327">う</span><span begin="19.327" end="19.465">な</span><span begin="19.465" end="19.898">胸</span> <span begin="19.898" end="20.226">押</span><span begin="20.226" end="20.391">さ</span><span begin="20.391" end="20.611">え</span><span begin="20.611" end="20.936">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">压抑着快要破膛而出的情感</span></p><p begin="20.936" end="25.815" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="20.936" end="21.070">今</span><span begin="21.070" end="21.264">日</span><span begin="21.264" end="21.541">も</span><span begin="21.541" end="21.802">ま</span><span begin="21.802" end="23.120">た</span> <span begin="23.120" end="23.445">あ</span><span begin="23.445" end="23.530">あ、</span><span begin="23.530" end="24.120">僕</span><span begin="24.120" end="24.430">は</span><span begin="24.430" end="24.759">孤</span><span begin="24.759" end="25.446">独</span><span begin="25.446" end="25.815">だ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">今天的我也依旧是孤身一人</span></p><p begin="26.103" end="28.029" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="26.103" end="26.532">Why</span> <span begin="26.532" end="26.690">should</span> <span begin="26.690" end="27.167">I</span> <span begin="27.167" end="27.645">believe</span> <span begin="27.645" end="28.029">in？</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我为何要相信？</span></p><p begin="28.546" end="32.888" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="28.546" end="29.084">痛</span><span begin="29.084" end="29.300">み</span><span begin="29.300" end="29.718">は</span><span begin="29.718" end="29.819">折</span><span begin="29.819" end="29.998">り</span><span begin="29.998" end="30.588">重</span><span begin="30.588" end="30.778">な</span><span begin="30.778" end="30.924">っ</span><span begin="30.924" end="31.108">て</span><span begin="31.108" end="31.585">枷</span><span begin="31.585" end="31.887">に</span><span begin="31.887" end="32.201">な</span><span begin="32.201" end="32.888">る</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">痛苦层层堆叠变为枷锁</span></p><p begin="33.511" end="36.270" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="33.511" end="33.649">泣</span><span begin="33.649" end="33.791">い</span><span begin="33.791" end="34.090">て</span><span begin="34.090" end="34.194">い</span><span begin="34.194" end="34.471">る</span><span begin="34.471" end="35.128">暇</span><span begin="35.128" end="35.467">も</span><span begin="35.467" end="35.609">な</span><span begin="35.609" end="35.788">い</span><span begin="35.788" end="36.270">よ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就连哭泣的时间也未曾留下</span></p><p begin="37.025" end="42.080" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="37.025" end="37.379">救</span><span begin="37.379" end="37.502">い</span><span begin="37.502" end="37.693">の</span><span begin="37.693" end="37.816">な</span><span begin="37.816" end="38.309">い</span><span begin="38.309" end="39.007">夜</span><span begin="39.007" end="39.619">が</span> <span begin="39.619" end="40.153">諦</span><span begin="40.153" end="40.291">め</span><span begin="40.291" end="40.493">て</span><span begin="40.493" end="40.556">い</span><span begin="40.556" end="40.913">く</span><span begin="40.913" end="41.590">朝</span><span begin="41.590" end="42.080">が</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">毫无救赎的夜晚 心灰意冷的清晨</span></p><p begin="42.594" end="46.695" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="42.594" end="43.202">何</span><span begin="43.202" end="43.480">度</span><span begin="43.480" end="43.760">も</span><span begin="43.760" end="44.499">通</span><span begin="44.499" end="44.652">り</span><span begin="44.652" end="45.114">過</span><span begin="45.114" end="45.442">ぎ</span><span begin="45.442" end="45.748">て</span><span begin="45.748" end="46.113">い</span><span begin="46.113" end="46.695">く</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这样的每一天已经重复了无数遍</span></p><p begin="47.494" end="51.253" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="47.494" end="47.703">無</span><span begin="47.703" end="48.353">残</span><span begin="48.353" end="48.655">に</span><span begin="48.655" end="49.020">潰</span><span begin="49.020" end="49.303">え</span><span begin="49.303" end="49.972">た</span> <span begin="49.972" end="50.155">希</span><span begin="50.155" end="50.443">望</span><span begin="50.443" end="50.614">の</span><span begin="50.614" end="51.253">跡</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">希望的火种已经无情破灭</span></p><p begin="51.253" end="56.449" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="51.253" end="51.910">遺</span><span begin="51.910" end="52.955">さ</span><span begin="52.955" end="53.067">れ</span><span begin="53.067" end="54.142">た</span><span begin="54.142" end="54.863">灯</span><span begin="54.863" end="55.423">火</span> <span begin="55.423" end="55.701">揺</span><span begin="55.701" end="55.919">れ</span><span begin="55.919" end="56.449">た</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">只剩下星点光芒在黑暗中摇曳</span></p><p begin="56.064" end="56.953" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="56.064" end="56.202">Still</span> <span begin="56.202" end="56.953">breathing</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我还活着</span></p><p begin="57.109" end="59.338" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="57.109" end="57.662">Nothing</span> <span begin="57.662" end="58.088">lasts</span> <span begin="58.088" end="59.338">forever</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">即使我所做的一切都徒劳无功</span></p><p begin="59.544" end="1:01.851" itunes:key="L13" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="59.544" end="59.715">No</span> <span begin="59.715" end="1:00.003">tears</span> <span begin="1:00.003" end="1:00.275">of</span> <span begin="1:00.275" end="1:00.559">rain</span> <span begin="1:00.559" end="1:00.731">fall</span> <span begin="1:00.731" end="1:01.851">forever</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">眼泪总会有流尽的一天</span></p><p begin="1:02.075" end="1:07.444" itunes:key="L14" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:02.075" end="1:02.500">誰</span><span begin="1:02.500" end="1:02.792">か</span><span begin="1:02.792" end="1:03.139">の</span><span begin="1:03.139" end="1:03.437">振</span><span begin="1:03.437" end="1:03.523">り</span><span begin="1:03.523" end="1:03.736">か</span><span begin="1:03.736" end="1:03.859">ざ</span><span begin="1:03.859" end="1:03.963">し</span><span begin="1:03.963" end="1:04.475">た</span><span begin="1:04.475" end="1:04.816">正</span><span begin="1:04.816" end="1:05.789">義</span><span begin="1:05.789" end="1:06.346">が</span><span begin="1:06.346" end="1:07.000">痛</span><span begin="1:07.000" end="1:07.112">く</span><span begin="1:07.112" end="1:07.444">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">被他人标榜的正义 隐隐刺痛</span></p><p begin="1:07.444" end="1:12.213" itunes:key="L15" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:07.444" end="1:08.041">誰</span><span begin="1:08.041" end="1:08.359">か</span><span begin="1:08.359" end="1:08.497">が</span><span begin="1:08.497" end="1:08.631">泣</span><span begin="1:08.631" end="1:08.769">い</span><span begin="1:08.769" end="1:09.090">て</span><span begin="1:09.090" end="1:09.829">も</span> <span begin="1:09.829" end="1:09.960">ま</span><span begin="1:09.960" end="1:10.341">た</span><span begin="1:10.341" end="1:11.022">胸</span><span begin="1:11.022" end="1:11.130">が</span><span begin="1:11.130" end="1:11.257">痛</span><span begin="1:11.257" end="1:11.690">ん</span><span begin="1:11.690" end="1:12.213">で</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">无论是谁在哭泣 胸口依然疼痛</span></p><p begin="1:12.347" end="1:17.801" itunes:key="L16" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:12.347" end="1:12.519">そ</span><span begin="1:12.519" end="1:12.885">れ</span><span begin="1:12.885" end="1:13.191">ぞ</span><span begin="1:13.191" end="1:13.475">れ</span><span begin="1:13.475" end="1:13.616">の</span><span begin="1:13.616" end="1:13.971">真</span><span begin="1:13.971" end="1:14.266">実</span><span begin="1:14.266" end="1:14.785">に</span><span begin="1:14.785" end="1:15.095">傷</span><span begin="1:15.095" end="1:16.047">付</span><span begin="1:16.047" end="1:16.189">い</span><span begin="1:16.189" end="1:16.625">た</span><span begin="1:16.625" end="1:16.998">と</span><span begin="1:16.998" end="1:17.058">し</span><span begin="1:17.058" end="1:17.286">て</span><span begin="1:17.286" end="1:17.801">も</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">即使彼此的真相让我们伤痕累累</span></p><p begin="1:17.801" end="1:24.155" itunes:key="L17" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:17.801" end="1:18.932">僕</span><span begin="1:18.932" end="1:19.324">は</span> <span begin="1:19.324" end="1:19.922">全</span><span begin="1:19.922" end="1:20.205">て</span><span begin="1:20.205" end="1:21.938">を</span><span begin="1:21.938" end="1:22.236">許</span><span begin="1:22.236" end="1:22.344">す</span><span begin="1:22.344" end="1:22.546">し</span><span begin="1:22.546" end="1:22.725">か</span><span begin="1:22.725" end="1:22.942">な</span><span begin="1:22.942" end="1:23.076">い</span><span begin="1:23.076" end="1:24.155">よ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我也只能选择原谅这一切</span></p><p begin="1:33.190" end="1:35.249" itunes:key="L18" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:33.190" end="1:33.597">What</span> <span begin="1:33.597" end="1:33.830">am</span> <span begin="1:33.830" end="1:34.300">I</span> <span begin="1:34.300" end="1:34.780">looking</span> <span begin="1:34.780" end="1:35.249">for？</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我在追寻什么？</span></p><p begin="1:35.510" end="1:38.342" itunes:key="L19" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:35.510" end="1:35.786">屈</span><span begin="1:35.786" end="1:36.182">託</span><span begin="1:36.182" end="1:36.433">無</span><span begin="1:36.433" end="1:36.732">い</span><span begin="1:36.732" end="1:37.041">空</span><span begin="1:37.041" end="1:37.345">の</span><span begin="1:37.345" end="1:38.017">青</span><span begin="1:38.017" end="1:38.342">が</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">视线望向头顶的湛蓝天空</span></p><p begin="1:38.342" end="1:43.484" itunes:key="L20" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:38.342" end="1:38.472">今</span><span begin="1:38.472" end="1:38.689">日</span><span begin="1:38.689" end="1:38.977">も</span><span begin="1:38.977" end="1:39.254">ま</span><span begin="1:39.254" end="1:40.801">た</span> <span begin="1:40.801" end="1:41.564">僕</span><span begin="1:41.564" end="1:41.846">を</span><span begin="1:41.846" end="1:42.097">突</span><span begin="1:42.097" end="1:42.470">き</span><span begin="1:42.470" end="1:42.817">放</span><span begin="1:42.817" end="1:43.484">す</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">宿命今日也将我推向深渊</span></p><p begin="1:43.601" end="1:45.553" itunes:key="L21" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:43.601" end="1:43.958">Why</span> <span begin="1:43.958" end="1:44.550">light</span> <span begin="1:44.550" end="1:44.748">births</span> <span begin="1:44.748" end="1:45.553">shadow？</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">为何追寻光明的道路总会伴随暗影</span></p><p begin="1:45.980" end="1:48.577" itunes:key="L22" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:45.980" end="1:46.422">救</span><span begin="1:46.422" end="1:46.492">い</span><span begin="1:46.492" end="1:46.716">な</span><span begin="1:46.716" end="1:46.854">ど</span><span begin="1:46.854" end="1:47.041">な</span><span begin="1:47.041" end="1:47.126">い</span><span begin="1:47.126" end="1:47.292">と</span><span begin="1:47.292" end="1:47.436">知</span><span begin="1:47.436" end="1:47.665">り</span><span begin="1:47.665" end="1:47.953">な</span><span begin="1:47.953" end="1:48.358">が</span><span begin="1:48.358" end="1:48.577">ら</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">纵使内心深知 希望从来渺茫</span></p><p begin="1:48.668" end="1:53.825" itunes:key="L23" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:48.668" end="1:48.966">そ</span><span begin="1:48.966" end="1:49.257">れ</span><span begin="1:49.257" end="1:49.542">で</span><span begin="1:49.542" end="1:51.116">も</span> <span begin="1:51.116" end="1:51.265">刻</span><span begin="1:51.265" end="1:51.542">ん</span><span begin="1:51.542" end="1:51.617">で</span><span begin="1:51.617" end="1:51.777">い</span><span begin="1:51.777" end="1:52.145">く</span><span begin="1:52.145" end="1:52.865">足</span><span begin="1:52.865" end="1:53.825">跡</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我也想在这片大地上 留下前行的足迹</span></p><p begin="1:54.534" end="1:56.798" itunes:key="L24" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:54.534" end="1:54.822">悲</span><span begin="1:54.822" end="1:54.929">し</span><span begin="1:54.929" end="1:55.073">み</span><span begin="1:55.073" end="1:55.398">に</span><span begin="1:55.398" end="1:55.686">も</span><span begin="1:55.686" end="1:56.073">慣</span><span begin="1:56.073" end="1:56.393">れ</span><span begin="1:56.393" end="1:56.798">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">对于悲痛我早就习以为常</span></p><p begin="1:56.918" end="1:59.377" itunes:key="L25" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:56.918" end="1:57.089">逃</span><span begin="1:57.089" end="1:57.238">げ</span><span begin="1:57.238" end="1:57.398">る</span><span begin="1:57.398" end="1:57.558">こ</span><span begin="1:57.558" end="1:57.734">と</span><span begin="1:57.734" end="1:57.947">に</span><span begin="1:57.947" end="1:58.027">す</span><span begin="1:58.027" end="1:58.246">ら</span><span begin="1:58.246" end="1:58.614">疲</span><span begin="1:58.614" end="1:58.987">れ</span><span begin="1:58.987" end="1:59.377">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">也厌倦了不断逃避</span></p><p begin="1:59.963" end="2:04.139" itunes:key="L26" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:59.963" end="2:00.491">心</span><span begin="2:00.491" end="2:00.822">が</span><span begin="2:00.822" end="2:01.222">痛</span><span begin="2:01.222" end="2:01.318">く</span><span begin="2:01.318" end="2:01.558">て</span><span begin="2:01.558" end="2:01.979">も</span> <span begin="2:01.979" end="2:02.539">泣</span><span begin="2:02.539" end="2:02.875">け</span><span begin="2:02.875" end="2:03.179">な</span><span begin="2:03.179" end="2:03.537">く</span><span begin="2:03.537" end="2:04.139">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">心脏剧痛却无法发出声音</span></p><p begin="2:04.716" end="2:07.124" itunes:key="L27" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:04.716" end="2:04.847">何</span><span begin="2:04.847" end="2:04.964">処</span><span begin="2:04.964" end="2:05.108">か</span><span begin="2:05.108" end="2:05.252">に</span><span begin="2:05.252" end="2:05.743">辿</span><span begin="2:05.743" end="2:06.063">り</span><span begin="2:06.063" end="2:06.377">着</span><span begin="2:06.377" end="2:06.703">け</span><span begin="2:06.703" end="2:07.124">ば</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">如果真的能到达约定的彼方</span></p><p begin="2:07.417" end="2:11.225" itunes:key="L28" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:07.417" end="2:07.524">い</span><span begin="2:07.524" end="2:07.689">つ</span><span begin="2:07.689" end="2:07.823">か</span><span begin="2:07.823" end="2:08.025">は</span> <span begin="2:08.025" end="2:08.655">笑</span><span begin="2:08.655" end="2:08.932">え</span><span begin="2:08.932" end="2:09.247">る</span><span begin="2:09.247" end="2:10.319">の</span><span begin="2:10.319" end="2:10.452">か</span><span begin="2:10.452" end="2:10.644">な</span><span begin="2:10.644" end="2:11.225">ぁ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">或许才可以露出笑容</span></p><p begin="2:11.572" end="2:16.948" itunes:key="L29" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:11.572" end="2:11.855">ま</span><span begin="2:11.855" end="2:12.180">だ</span> <span begin="2:12.180" end="2:12.676">息</span><span begin="2:12.676" end="2:12.888">を</span><span begin="2:12.888" end="2:12.946">し</span><span begin="2:12.946" end="2:13.266">て</span><span begin="2:13.266" end="2:13.700">る</span> <span begin="2:13.700" end="2:14.057">Still</span> <span begin="2:14.057" end="2:16.948">breathing</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我还有气息 我仍在挣扎求生</span></p><p begin="2:34.129" end="2:38.219" itunes:key="L30" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:34.129" end="2:34.657">何</span><span begin="2:34.657" end="2:34.939">度</span><span begin="2:34.939" end="2:36.740">も</span> <span begin="2:36.740" end="2:37.270">何</span><span begin="2:37.270" end="2:37.665">度</span><span begin="2:37.665" end="2:38.219">も</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">多少次 多少次</span><span ttm:role="x-bg" begin="2:35.428" end="2:39.258"><span begin="2:35.428" end="2:35.999">(何</span><span begin="2:35.999" end="2:36.277">度</span><span begin="2:36.277" end="2:38.047">も</span> <span begin="2:38.047" end="2:38.565">何</span><span begin="2:38.565" end="2:38.917">度</span><span begin="2:38.917" end="2:39.258">も)</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">多少次 多少次</span></span></p><p begin="2:39.284" end="2:43.512" itunes:key="L31" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:39.284" end="2:39.387">あ</span><span begin="2:39.387" end="2:39.604">あ</span> <span begin="2:39.604" end="2:39.817">ま</span><span begin="2:39.817" end="2:40.228">た</span><span begin="2:40.228" end="2:41.273">だ、</span><span begin="2:41.273" end="2:41.861">壊</span><span begin="2:41.861" end="2:42.192">れ</span><span begin="2:42.192" end="2:42.379">て</span><span begin="2:42.379" end="2:42.709">し</span><span begin="2:42.709" end="2:43.072">ま</span><span begin="2:43.072" end="2:43.512">う</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">都处在行将崩坏的边缘</span></p><p begin="2:44.499" end="2:55.343" itunes:key="L32" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:44.499" end="2:44.797">繰</span><span begin="2:44.797" end="2:44.973">り</span><span begin="2:44.973" end="2:47.043">返</span><span begin="2:47.043" end="2:47.357">し</span><span begin="2:47.357" end="2:47.592">の</span><span begin="2:47.592" end="2:49.640">中</span> <span begin="2:49.640" end="2:49.939">今</span><span begin="2:49.939" end="2:50.216">日</span><span begin="2:50.216" end="2:50.607">も</span><span begin="2:50.607" end="2:51.522">僕</span><span begin="2:51.522" end="2:52.217">は</span><span begin="2:52.217" end="2:52.905">息</span><span begin="2:52.905" end="2:53.204">を</span><span begin="2:53.204" end="2:53.993">す</span><span begin="2:53.993" end="2:55.343">る</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">可在无尽的轮回过后 今天的我尚有一线生机</span><span ttm:role="x-bg" begin="2:45.768" end="2:49.565"><span begin="2:45.768" end="2:46.125">(繰</span><span begin="2:46.125" end="2:46.275">り</span><span begin="2:46.275" end="2:48.387">返</span><span begin="2:48.387" end="2:48.648">し</span><span begin="2:48.648" end="2:48.856">の</span><span begin="2:48.856" end="2:49.565">中)</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在无尽的轮回过后</span></span></p><p begin="2:57.362" end="2:58.216" itunes:key="L33" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:57.362" end="2:57.709">Still</span> <span begin="2:57.709" end="2:58.216">breathing</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">尚存一息</span></p><p begin="2:58.424" end="3:00.434" itunes:key="L34" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:58.424" end="2:58.946">Nothing</span> <span begin="2:58.946" end="2:59.389">lasts</span> <span begin="2:59.389" end="3:00.434">forever</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">即使我所做的一切都徒劳无功</span></p><p begin="3:00.792" end="3:04.673" itunes:key="L35" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:00.792" end="3:01.217">冷</span><span begin="3:01.217" end="3:01.542">た</span><span begin="3:01.542" end="3:01.964">い</span><span begin="3:01.964" end="3:02.342">運</span><span begin="3:02.342" end="3:02.694">命</span><span begin="3:02.694" end="3:03.329">に</span><span begin="3:03.329" end="3:03.542">飲</span><span begin="3:03.542" end="3:03.841">ま</span><span begin="3:03.841" end="3:04.140">れ</span><span begin="3:04.140" end="3:04.428">て</span><span begin="3:04.428" end="3:04.673">も</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">即使我终将被冷酷的命运吞没</span></p><p begin="3:04.673" end="3:08.523" itunes:key="L36" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:04.673" end="3:04.772">消</span><span begin="3:04.772" end="3:04.874">え</span><span begin="3:04.874" end="3:05.082">そ</span><span begin="3:05.082" end="3:05.231">う</span><span begin="3:05.231" end="3:05.828">な</span><span begin="3:05.828" end="3:06.624">灯</span><span begin="3:06.624" end="3:07.600">火</span><span begin="3:07.600" end="3:08.027">を</span><span begin="3:08.027" end="3:08.187">手</span><span begin="3:08.187" end="3:08.523">に</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我也要将最后的那点残烛握在手心</span></p><p begin="3:08.731" end="3:13.435" itunes:key="L37" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:08.731" end="3:09.163">潰</span><span begin="3:09.163" end="3:09.350">れ</span><span begin="3:09.350" end="3:09.520">そ</span><span begin="3:09.520" end="3:09.664">う</span><span begin="3:09.664" end="3:09.876">な</span><span begin="3:09.876" end="3:10.422">夜</span><span begin="3:10.422" end="3:11.083">も</span> <span begin="3:11.083" end="3:11.510">歩</span><span begin="3:11.510" end="3:11.808">み</span><span begin="3:11.808" end="3:12.139">は</span><span begin="3:12.139" end="3:12.326">止</span><span begin="3:12.326" end="3:12.678">め</span><span begin="3:12.678" end="3:12.752">な</span><span begin="3:12.752" end="3:13.046">い</span><span begin="3:13.046" end="3:13.435">よ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">身处不见尽头的漫漫长夜也不会停下脚步</span></p><p begin="3:13.643" end="3:18.742" itunes:key="L38" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:13.643" end="3:13.792">そ</span><span begin="3:13.792" end="3:14.102">れ</span><span begin="3:14.102" end="3:14.443">ぞ</span><span begin="3:14.443" end="3:14.752">れ</span><span begin="3:14.752" end="3:14.918">の</span><span begin="3:14.918" end="3:15.243">真</span><span begin="3:15.243" end="3:15.590">実</span><span begin="3:15.590" end="3:16.096">と</span><span begin="3:16.096" end="3:16.832">痛</span><span begin="3:16.832" end="3:17.318">み</span><span begin="3:17.318" end="3:17.947">の</span><span begin="3:17.947" end="3:18.283">果</span><span begin="3:18.283" end="3:18.491">て</span><span begin="3:18.491" end="3:18.742">に</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">即便在彼此的真相与痛楚的尽头</span></p><p begin="3:19.035" end="3:24.197" itunes:key="L39" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:19.035" end="3:19.983">い</span><span begin="3:19.983" end="3:20.132">つ</span><span begin="3:20.132" end="3:20.559">か</span> <span begin="3:20.559" end="3:21.311">全</span><span begin="3:21.311" end="3:21.577">て</span><span begin="3:21.577" end="3:22.532">が</span><span begin="3:22.532" end="3:23.188">壊</span><span begin="3:23.188" end="3:23.497">れ</span><span begin="3:23.497" end="3:23.860">て</span><span begin="3:23.860" end="3:24.197">も</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">所有东西都将被摧毁殆尽 我也不会停下脚步</span></p><p begin="3:24.199" end="3:28.187" itunes:key="L40" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:24.199" end="3:24.827">「何</span><span begin="3:24.827" end="3:25.457">の</span><span begin="3:25.457" end="3:25.771">た</span><span begin="3:25.771" end="3:26.422">め？</span><span begin="3:26.422" end="3:27.153">誰</span><span begin="3:27.153" end="3:27.371">の</span><span begin="3:27.371" end="3:27.574">た</span><span begin="3:27.574" end="3:27.761">め</span><span begin="3:27.761" end="3:28.187">に？」</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">为了什么？又为了谁？</span></p><p begin="3:28.247" end="3:33.325" itunes:key="L41" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:28.247" end="3:28.631">応</span><span begin="3:28.631" end="3:28.898">え</span><span begin="3:28.898" end="3:29.036">は</span><span begin="3:29.036" end="3:29.164">な</span><span begin="3:29.164" end="3:29.959">く</span> <span begin="3:29.959" end="3:30.562">箱</span><span begin="3:30.562" end="3:30.860">舟</span><span begin="3:30.860" end="3:31.512">は</span><span begin="3:31.512" end="3:31.826">終</span><span begin="3:31.826" end="3:32.293">幕</span><span begin="3:32.293" end="3:32.360">を</span><span begin="3:32.360" end="3:32.888">辿</span><span begin="3:32.888" end="3:33.325">る</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">无需回答 方舟只会抵达它该去的终点</span></p><p begin="3:33.576" end="3:38.263" itunes:key="L42" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:33.576" end="3:33.816">せ</span><span begin="3:33.816" end="3:34.093">め</span><span begin="3:34.093" end="3:34.434">て</span><span begin="3:34.434" end="3:35.544">少</span><span begin="3:35.544" end="3:36.082">し</span><span begin="3:36.082" end="3:36.224">で</span><span begin="3:36.224" end="3:36.717">も</span> <span begin="3:36.717" end="3:36.846">こ</span><span begin="3:36.846" end="3:36.930">の</span><span begin="3:36.930" end="3:37.168">灯</span><span begin="3:37.168" end="3:37.355">火</span> <span begin="3:37.355" end="3:37.864">繋</span><span begin="3:37.864" end="3:37.955">ぐ</span><span begin="3:37.955" end="3:38.056">よ</span><span begin="3:38.056" end="3:38.263">う</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">至少传下一缕希望的灯火</span></p><p begin="3:38.506" end="3:48.064" itunes:key="L43" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:38.506" end="3:39.930">囁</span><span begin="3:39.930" end="3:40.277">く</span><span begin="3:40.277" end="3:40.432">よ</span><span begin="3:40.432" end="3:40.634">う</span><span begin="3:40.634" end="3:41.226">に</span><span begin="3:41.226" end="3:41.792">唄</span><span begin="3:41.792" end="3:43.734">う</span> <span begin="3:43.734" end="3:44.458">祈</span><span begin="3:44.458" end="3:45.040">る</span><span begin="3:45.040" end="3:45.317">よ</span><span begin="3:45.317" end="3:45.717">う</span><span begin="3:45.717" end="3:46.421">に</span><span begin="3:46.421" end="3:47.088">唄</span><span begin="3:47.088" end="3:48.064">う</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">轻声哼唱 在祈祷和希冀中继续前行</span></p><p begin="3:48.384" end="3:55.248" itunes:key="L44" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:48.384" end="3:48.704">I</span> <span begin="3:48.704" end="3:49.296">sing</span> <span begin="3:49.296" end="3:49.920">“ark</span> <span begin="3:49.920" end="3:55.248">song”</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这便是我的方舟之歌</span></p></div></body></tt>